    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Suite \u00e0 une soir\u00e9e trop arros\u00e9e et une nuit inoubliable avec une inconnue, Manu se r\u00e9veille seul avec un message sur son bras lui donnant rendez-vous \u00e0 Avignon. Persuad\u00e9 qu\u2019il s\u2019agit de la femme de sa vie, il est pr\u00eat \u00e0 tout pour la retrouver. Manu embarque, malgr\u00e9 lui, son pote Fred sur la route. Ce qui semblait \u00eatre une simple vir\u00e9e entre amis va vite tourner \u00e0 la catastrophe.",
        "english": "After a drunken evening and an unforgettable night with a total stranger, Manu wakes up alone to find a message on his arm giving him an appointment in Avignon. Convinced that the appointment is with the dreamy woman from the night before, he is ready to do anything to find her again. Despite his better judgement, Manu takes his pal Fred along for the ride. What seemed to be a simple trip between friends quickly turns into disaster."
